# Desktop build output: Hutch projects the selected Electrobun devkit into
# `.hutch/devkit/` (a copy of a release's SDK, not a source file), a build or a
# package lands in `build/` and `artifacts/`, and a dev run stages the running
# bundle's scratch beside the crate in `.cottontail-tmp/`.
/crates/desktop/.hutch/
/crates/desktop/build/
/crates/desktop/artifacts/
/crates/desktop/target/
/crates/desktop/.cottontail-tmp/

